        <p>Majority for Warrington, 122. • Flixton Rooluick v. Harpurhey ComeLery.—At Prest- wich. Roebuck, 231 ; Harpurhey. 16.1. Chorlton Bowling Green v. Prestwich George.—At Swinton Liberal Club. George, 195; Chorlton 8.G.,210. Leigh Limited v. Cirter's Arms, Sale.—Flaved at Nag's Head, Cr-)fts Bank. Leigh Limited, 233; Csrter's Arms, Sale, 163. Kersal Moor v. Knutsford.—At Bowdon Griffin. Kersal Moor, 211 ; Knutsfori, 182.</p>
